comment.body:
Thanks for the report. The current thread shows the symptom, but it still mixes two different trigger moments: PowerToys startup and wake-from-sleep. To narrow this down, could you please provide:
1. exact numbered steps for the startup case and, separately, for the sleep/wake case;
2. whether the failure affects single-key remaps, shortcut remaps, or both; and whether toggling Keyboard Manager off/on restores them;
3. one concrete remap example that fails; and
4. a fresh diagnostic bundle captured immediately after the failure by commenting /bugreport on the issue and attaching the generated ZIP.
That will let us compare the failing moment instead of guessing between startup timing and resume-state handling.
